  "post_title": "Lorenzo Ramírez pinta en Onda su evolución ante estudiantes de actividades formativas municipales",
  "post_date": "2014-04-30 20:49:50",
  "post_name": "lorenzo-ramirez-pinta-en-onda-su-evolucion-ante-estudiantes-de-actividades-formativas-municipales",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Lorenzo Ram&iacute;rez ha pintado la tarde de este martes cuatro cuadros con diferentes t&eacute;cnicas, para mostrar su evoluci&oacute;n y la del arte ante<span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 21.33333396911621px;\">&nbsp;estudiantes de pintura de las actividades formativas municipales.</span></span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/04/IMG_7753.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 21.33333396911621px;\">Mientras tanto, el especialista&nbsp;en arte de Onda Joan Feliu Franch, iba explicando entre los cuadros que Lorenzo presenta en el Centro de Empleo y Cultura las diferentes etapas de la pintura. El grupo de estudiantes estaba acompa&ntilde;ado por sus profesoras, Bego&ntilde;a Molina, de t&eacute;cnicas mixtas, y Mari Carmen Vidal Casta&ntilde;, de pintura al &oacute;leo.</span></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/demostraciolorenzoestudiantactivitatsformativesonda/img_7727.jpg\" alt=\"img_7727\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/demostraciolorenzoestudiantactivitatsformativesonda/img_7728.jpg\" alt=\"img_7728\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/demostraciolorenzoestudiantactivitatsformativesonda/img_7729.jpg\" alt=\"img_7729\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/demostraciolorenzoestudiantactivitatsformativesonda/img_7730.jpg\" alt=\"img_7730\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/demostraciolorenzoestudiantactivitatsformativesonda/img_7731.jpg\" alt=\"img_7731\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/demostraciolorenzoestudiantactivitatsformativesonda/img_7733.jpg\" alt=\"img_7733\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/demostraciolorenzoestudiantactivitatsformativesonda/img_7734.jpg\" alt=\"img_7734\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/demostraciolorenzoestudiantactivitatsformativesonda/img_7736.jpg\" alt=\"img_7736\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/demostraciolorenzoestudiantactivitatsformativesonda/img_7737.jpg\" alt=\"img_7737\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/demostraciolorenzoestudiantactivitatsformativesonda/img_7738.jpg\" alt=\"img_7738\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/demostraciolorenzoestudiantactivitatsformativesonda/img_7739.jpg\" alt=\"img_7739\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/demostraciolorenzoestudiantactivitatsformativesonda/img_7741.jpg\" alt=\"img_7741\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/demostraciolorenzoestudiantactivitatsformativesonda/img_7742.jpg\" alt=\"img_7742\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/demostraciolorenzoestudiantactivitatsformativesonda/img_7743.jpg\" alt=\"img_7743\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/demostraciolorenzoestudiantactivitatsformativesonda/img_7744.jpg\" alt=\"img_7744\" st